Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["GWPTools Prototype Engines", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001706625210277*^9, 
  4.0017066411931067`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0b4014e7-c7bf-48d3-8e24-\
8279f7a5809b"],

Cell["Jeremy B. Maddox", "Author",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988201532003448*^9, 
  3.988201536787407*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f614135e-620f-46ac-9249-\
be9404456b2c"],

Cell["\<\
Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry
Western Kentucky University
Bowling Green, KY 42101-1079
Email: jeremy.maddox@wku.edu\
\>", "Affiliation",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988201549259402*^9, 
  3.988201579115401*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"467a62ef-6906-409d-8973-\
e472e6972f05"],

Cell["\<\
While the base GWPTools package provides a comprehensive environment for \
single-component, one-dimensional (1D) Gaussian wavepackets, modeling \
realistic problems in chemical dynamics and quantum mechanics frequently \
requires multidimensional coordinate spaces, quantum interference across \
coherent superpositions, and open-system environmental coupling. This \
document introduces the suite of analytical prototype engines developed for \
GWPTools\[LongDash]encompassing two-dimensional wavepackets (GWPEngine2D), \
two-state and multi-component coherent superpositions (GWPEngineSS1D and \
GWPEngineMC1D), and one-dimensional open-system reduced density matrices \
governed by the Caldeira\[Dash]Leggett master equation (GWPEngineRDM1D). Each \
extension registers seamlessly into the core GWPTools introspection and \
property framework, extending exact, closed-form analytical propagation to \
coupled 2D harmonic surfaces, interfering wavepacket trains, and dissipative \
thermal relaxation. We illustrate the package loading workflow, metadata \
introspection queries, constructor syntax, and analytical time evolution \
across all four prototype wavepacket types.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001707165591563*^9, 
  4.001707169156678*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"38f6a9d5-06ec-45ac-bbd3-\
71da4e8d97c2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Loading the package", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000898946388177*^9, 
  4.000898948681229*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a5444863-e6cd-4c51-a6af-\
4d372cb09d28"],

Cell["\<\
Load the GWPTools package. To comply with Wolfram Paclet Repository standards\
\[LongDash]which prohibit packages from placing symbols in the Global context\
\[LongDash]all public-facing symbols are scoped under my Wolfram Publisher ID \
context, MaddoxScience.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000892812364814*^9, 4.000893015277363*^9}, 
   4.000893054979403*^9, {4.001707235355335*^9, 4.0017072431278067`*^9}, 
   4.0017080805077133`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"4ebcdbca-eddc-4c56-a49a-\
45fc5a929205"],

