Cell["\<\
The interactive table below displays the complete 1D property metadata \
organized by class. In practice, the ShortKey aliases are particularly \
convenient for rapid coding. Notice the DynamicClass and StaticClass entries: \
these govern how a property is evaluated when a \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Potential\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] option is specified \
(a time-dependent dynamic state) versus omitted (a stationary static state).\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000893347455996*^9, 4.000893501366549*^9}, 
   4.001708251664125*^9},ExpressionUUID->"c1264c35-41b2-4901-83ca-\
fb88ca2fca0c"],

