Cell["\<\
Below is a static, fully symbolic 2D wavepacket. The positional arguments are \
the two-by-two symmetric shape matrix, the position center vector, the \
momentum center vector, and the complex scalar phase, followed by optional \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]HBAR\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] and \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MASS\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] rules:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.000899561028166*^9, 4.000899570834393*^9}, {
